      "guid": "com.awnova.raidsettingsskipper",
      "name": "Raid Settings Skipper",
      "slug": "raid-settings-skipper",
      "teaser": "Skips the raid settings screen when fika server settings are disabled.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/v49epH1pydb3Wyw5IeqlTvbrU6dQbmg2YbAETROJ.png",
      "downloads": 747,
      "favourites_count": 8,
      "description": "<p>Skips the raid settings screen when fika server settings are disabled. No config needed It only skips if fika is configured to disabled letting users change raid settings.</p>\n<p>Approach inspired by no-insurance <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2690/no-insurance\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2690/no-insurance</a>, which showed me that these menu steps are best removed at the MainMenuControllerClass transition rather than papered over in the UI like my first attempt.</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2857/raid-settings-skipper",
      "fika_compatibility": true,
      "featured": false,
      "contains_ads": false,
      "contains_ai_content": true,
      "custom_ai_disclosure": "<p>I use AI to help find things in eft decomp faster and use it to help write comments in code. I’m really bad with English and attention span. It helps keep me on track.</p>\n",
